{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42246","headline":"咏梅子真送郭先辈 · 徐铉","name":"咏梅子真送郭先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忠臣本爱君，仁人本爱民。\n宁知贵与贱，岂计名与身。\n梅生爲一尉，献疏来君门。\n君门深万里，金虎重千钧。\n向永且不用，况复论子真。\n拂衣遂长往，高节邈无邻。\n至今仙籍中，谓之梅真人。\n郭生负逸气，百代继遗尘。\n进退生自知，得丧吾不陈。\n斯民苟有幸，期子一朝伸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42246.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42246","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}